  "prefLabel": "Mec 302.09 Scope of Master Plumber License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 302.09 Scope of Master Plumber License. An individual who meets the qualifications as a master plumber shall be deemed to be qualified as a journeyman plumber.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.12); (formerly Saf-Mec 302.11); ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36 (formerly Mec 302.11)",
